## Solver Comparison (Gaussian → TwoMoons)

| Solver | MMD↓ | Neural | Training Time |
|--------|------|--------|---------------|
| FBSDE | 0.23 | Yes | ~30s |
| Score-Based | 0.32 | Yes | ~20s |
| RKHS | 0.93 | No | ~5s |
| Doob (kernel) | ~0.50 | No | ~2s |

